    <string name="location_rationale">Domofon can show your gate automatically as you approach home. To do that, Android needs location access allowed <b>all the time</b>, because the check happens while the app is closed.\n\nYour location is used only on this device to measure the distance to the home position you entered. It is never sent anywhere, and it is never shared.\n\nThe rest of the app works without this.</string>
